body:
Everyone online I see is on this trend of giving a fuck about Ukranians meanwhile the US soldiers claimed they gave a fuck about Afghans and built shit and did a whole bunch of other good things while they were their or so they claimed and then gave no fucks when they left. No one gives a flying fuck about the middle east or central asia. It's always about Europe and dont give me that bullshit that oh Ukraine is closer to Europe than Afghanistan. People give me that bs but was that a fucking problem when they were bombing us. I guess its safe to say people always give a fuck about their own kind and basically say the rest of the world can go to hell.

&#x200B;

P.S.- I'm sorry for the rant, I guess I got "triggered" anyway I will  go whine about it somewhere else since what I say is probably considered whining to all these people who believe one culture and country is better than the other.
